{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters You\u2019ve Never Faced Before</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of Eastern horror like never before. For the first time in a VR horror game, you\u2019ll encounter traditional Eastern zombies\u2014relentless, eerie creatures that never stop once they\u2019ve spotted you. Prefer something more classic? Watch out for the gargoyle\u2019s razor-sharp teeth, or the sinister presence of voodoo spirits, demons, elves, ghosts, mummies, and more. Each monster is uniquely designed to make your skin crawl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death Isn\u2019t the End</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Lost Soul: Escape the Doom Museum, you don\u2019t die\u2014you transform. As a disembodied soul, you\u2019ll roam the haunted museum in search of a new host. Possess statues, artifacts, or even other beings to continue your journey. Death becomes part of the experience\u2014just like a true ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets Hidden Beyond Life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the main story lies a web of hidden secrets and ghostly lore, tucked away in the shadows of the museum. Some mysteries only reveal themselves after your spirit is freed from its host. Only by dying can you unlock certain paths and hidden narratives. In this world, death might be the key to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Living, Breathing Museum</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a richly detailed private museum, filled with artifacts, ancient relics, and even magical idols from across cultures and histories. As you flee from terrifying creatures, take a moment to examine the exhibits\u2014and even read real-world books scattered throughout the halls. It's part haunted house, part immersive history tour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Now \u2014 If You Dare</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into one of the most unique VR horror experiences yet. Possess, escape, uncover secrets, and survive the Doom Museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you break the curse\u2026 or become part of the collection?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Zombie-Suppressing Talisman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591340/6526bbf988def99dcd3c36fb3e02253e27b1ad3e.jpg"},{"name":"Strange Tales from a Chinese Studio","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591340/2d518c1ba3aa7005664de990539c8935ce956ca5.jpg"},{"name":"SURVIVOR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591340/883e7cb450801a57843925b808f8616ec72ee014.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591340?t=1758679552","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591340/a9e619048ba086fa9872990856fd0cb4d57a5d3f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758679552","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591340/e64c2358938f33ebb3873d0fb43c757a0258d2b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758679552","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591340/e64c2358938f33ebb3873d0fb43c757a0258d2b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758679552","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters You\u2019ve Never Faced Before</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of Eastern horror like never before. For the first time in a VR horror game, you\u2019ll encounter traditional Eastern zombies\u2014relentless, eerie creatures that never stop once they\u2019ve spotted you. Prefer something more classic? Watch out for the gargoyle\u2019s razor-sharp teeth, or the sinister presence of voodoo spirits, demons, elves, ghosts, mummies, and more. Each monster is uniquely d